    "body": "1.  From the Dispatch Console, navigate to Settings > Preferences > Subscriptions    2.  Add the number of seats to purchase or remove.  Click “Change Seats”    From the Mobile App: 1.  Click the Dispatch Tab.  Click the Menu Bars on the top right of the screen.    2.  Click: Settings > Preferences > Subscriptions. .           3.  Add the number of seats to purchase or remove.  Click \"Change Seats.\"  Video:  Add or Remove Seats",
